OL,3,AUS says sanctions will 'squash' Iran's
OL,4,Aeconomy and 'collapse' its regime
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent
OL,7,Furged US allies to support Washington's
OL,8,Fefforts to "squash" the Iranian
OL,9,Feconomy.
OL,11,F"We are going to collapse this regime.
OL,12,FIt is time for our allies and the rest
OL,13,Fof the world to make a decision,"
OL,14,FBessent told broadcaster CNBC.
OL,16,F"You are either with us or against us,"
OL,17,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
