OL,3,AUS says sanctions will 'squash' Iran's
OL,4,Aeconomy and 'collapse' its regime
OL,5,
OL,6,FBessent's remarks come after US
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump said that
OL,8,Fcountries providing "any type of
OL,9,Flifeline" to the Islamic Republic's
OL,10,Fregime will face "tremendous economic
OL,11,Fconsequences".
